      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Keep Brightpearl. Let chefs fix their own orders before it acts on them."
     },
     {
      "prop_id": "5e0d3c39-9fde-6661-5b10-e1aef4f809a4",
      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "Give us twenty minutes to talk one order through, change a product on screen and show the file your desk would get."
